# lf107, the open-door loom master (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 2: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle lf107
revision 2
state ready
dialect larkfield
accent light broad
tier full
written_for tn_mb_aspen_marshholm
written_by claude-codex-lf-1
title the open-door loom master
fits stage=adult|old
prefers talk=chatty
traits temper=even talk=chatty warmth=warm humour=merry honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk never_sits_with_a_back_to_the_door
