dislikes wet_floors gulls
fears a_wet_floor_near_the_looms a_late_wagon_leaving_workers_idle
hopes a_full_order_book_and_a_full_larder a_skilled_hand_at_every_loom
topics work +0.5 prices +0.4 home +0.3 pastimes +0.2
styles comfort=gentle gossip=curious refuse=plain tease=playful
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# keeps the #door# in view from the #desk#, tests each #bolt# of #linen#, and offers an #apple# before discussing a late #wagon#.

words
oath! = Shuttle and open gate | By the turning beam
saying! = Keep the doorway clear and the work moving | Count the hands before the bolts
loom = loom | linen loom
looms = looms | working looms
shuttle = shuttle | wooden shuttle
shuttles = shuttles | spare shuttles
